# Develop {{project_name}}

Parent: [Documentation index](README.md)

This project uses the `{{profile}}` TemplateRepo profile. VS Code recommendations
in `.vscode/extensions.json` are optional and scoped to this profile.

## Set up

Run `scripts/setup.ps1` from PowerShell or `scripts/setup.sh` from a POSIX shell.
The setup command is idempotent and changes only this project directory.

## Run checks

Run `scripts/check.ps1` from PowerShell or `scripts/check.sh` from a POSIX shell.
The command first validates repository and documentation structure, then runs
the profile-specific build and smoke tests.

## Tool ownership

The profile's `scripts/dev.py` is the executable authority for setup and checks.
Keep this page concise and link to the script instead of duplicating its command
sequence in multiple documents.
